        <h2>Delivery FAQ</h2>

        <h3>Do you ship across the UK?</h3>
        <p>Yes — UK-wide shipping is standard, and shipments are sent with tracking.</p>

        <h3>Can I choose the courier or service?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes. We usually pick a balanced option (reputation / time / price), but if you prefer Royal Mail, Evri, DPD,
          or an express service like Special Delivery (by 1pm) or DPD Next Day, just tell us during quoting.
        </p>

        <h3>How is shipping priced?</h3>
        <p>
          Shipping is charged separately from the part price and is billed <strong>at courier cost</strong> — no markup.
          The final cost depends on packed size, weight and service level.
        </p>

        <h3>Do you offer same-day delivery?</h3>
        <p>
          Same-day local delivery by car is possible in the local area if timing allows (workload, print completion time and distance).
          We’ll confirm availability before starting.
        </p>

        <h3>Can I collect locally?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes — collection is available by appointment in Brampton, Huntingdon (postcode area PE28 4SU).
          Exact pickup details are shared after we confirm the time.
        </p>

        <h3>Do you ship internationally?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes — international shipping is available on request and is sent with tracking (typically Royal Mail or UPS, depending on the job).
        </p>

        <h3>Will I need to pay customs, VAT or import fees?</h3>
        <p>
          Possibly, depending on your country. Import taxes/customs fees are the buyer’s responsibility.
          If prepayment is required for your shipment, we’ll confirm it before dispatch.
        </p>

        <h3>How are parts packaged?</h3>
        <p>
          Packaging is selected to protect the part and match the order. Small parts may ship in padded mailers to reduce costs,
          while larger or fragile items are boxed with protective filler. We also reuse clean, strong boxes from 3D printing supplies where appropriate.
        </p>

        <h3>Can you do individual packaging, labels or kitting for business orders?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes — bagging, labeling and kitting can be arranged upfront. This is common for commercial batches.
        </p>

        <h3>What if my parcel is lost or damaged?</h3>
        <p>
          If a tracked parcel hasn’t arrived within 10 working days after dispatch, we’ll offer a full refund (including shipping) or a reprint and reship.
          If items arrive damaged, contact us with photos and we’ll agree a fair solution (replacement or refund).
        </p>

        <h3>Where should I send files?</h3>
